OL,3,GNEWSATribute to 'much-loved' mum after
OL,4,Amurder arrest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman found dead at a house in
OL,7,FManchester has been described by her
OL,8,Ffamily as a "much-loved mum, nana,
OL,9,Fsister and auntie" with a "caring
OL,10,Fheart, strength and kindness".
OL,12,FYvonne Kemp was found at an address on
OL,13,FCrondall Street in Moss Side after
OL,14,Fpolice were called to reports of a
OL,15,Fdisturbance at about 13:30 BST on
OL,16,FMonday.
OL,18,FGreater Manchester Police launched a
OL,19,Fmurder investigation following her
OL,20,Fdeath. A 26-year-old woman has been
OL,21,Farrested on suspicion of murder and
OL,22,Fdetained under the Mental Health Act.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,408,400,260,160,0,100
